<title>USA: Manugistics Group completes 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Manugistics Group completes 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manugistics Group Inc said Thursday it has completed its previously announced two-for-one stock split, paid in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend was paid June 11 to shareholders of record May 23.</p>
